{"seq":2,"slug":"raffle-vs-queue-choice","title":"抽签 vs 排队的场景选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-experience-ops/raffle-vs-queue-choice","wordCount":2747,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽签-vs-排队的场景选择\">抽签 vs 排队的场景选择</h1><p>这是本 hub 里唯一直接讨论&quot;该不该用抽签&quot;的一篇。很多团队选择抽签，其实并不是因为抽签更适合，而是因为没算清楚排队需要多大的容量。这一篇把两种机制放在同一套量化框架下比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>抽签分配<strong>概率</strong>，排队分配<strong>到达顺序</strong>。这一篇用 Little&#39;s Law 量化排队的等待时长与容量需求，给出按需求供给比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 选型的判据，并说明降载与准入控制为什么是排队的必要配套。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种机制分配的是不同的东西\">两种机制分配的是不同的东西</h2><h3 id=\"分配依据决定了一切下游差异\">分配依据决定了一切下游差异</h3><p>先明确本质差异：抽签分配的是<strong>概率</strong>，排队分配的是<strong>到达顺序</strong>。这个差异决定了它们适用的场景完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>抽签（Raffle）</th>\n<th>排队（Virtual Queue / FCFS）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分配依据</td>\n<td>随机数</td>\n<td>到达时刻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户对结果的预期</td>\n<td>不确定，但概率公开</td>\n<td>确定，按位置递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对&quot;手速&quot;的敏感度</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器人优势</td>\n<td>仅在报名环节，靠多账号</td>\n<td>全程都占优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户感知的公平</td>\n<td>高（运气面前人人平等）</td>\n<td>中（拼的是资源和网络）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要的基础设施</td>\n<td>可验证随机 + 身份去重</td>\n<td>排队令牌 + 大容量削峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供给释放的再分配</td>\n<td>走候补队列（可保持公平）</td>\n<td>回到队首开放（机器人占优）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转化率</td>\n<td>偏低（有滞后与流失）</td>\n<td>偏高（即时性强）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的转化率差异是选型时最容易被低估的：抽签从报名到购买的链路长、跨度小时甚至数天，用户流失显著；排队是即时满足，转化更好。如果商品的稀缺程度不足以支撑&quot;运气分配&quot;的叙事，抽签带来的公平感收益可能不抵转化损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-little-s-law-量化排队需要多少容量\">用 Little&#39;s Law 量化排队需要多少容量</h2><h3 id=\"用有效到达率而不是原始到达率\">用有效到达率而不是原始到达率</h3><p>选择排队的团队必须回答一个问题：<strong>用户要等多久？</strong> 这个问题有现成的工具。<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little%27s_law\">Little&#39;s Law</a> 表述为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统内的平均用户数（含等待与服务中），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是有效进入速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户在系统内的平均时间。它的适用范围很宽——按标准表述，这个关系&quot;不受到达过程分布、服务分布、服务顺序的影响&quot;，唯一要求是系统处于稳定的遍历状态。</p>\n<p>用它做容量规划时，要注意一个容易出错的点：<strong>要使用有效到达率而不是原始到达率</strong>。在一个容量有限的系统里，被拒绝的用户不计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>假设一场发售有 6 万人到达，平均排队 + 购买的期望时长希望控制在 10 分钟（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tfrac{1}{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 小时）以内，则系统需要同时容纳：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60000</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 60000 \\times \\frac{1}{6} = 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即排队系统与结账系统合计要按<strong>同时在线约 1 万人</strong>设计。同时，系统的完成速率必须不低于 6 万人/小时（即 1000 人/分钟），否则积压会持续增长直到排队区满并开始拒绝。</p>\n<p>如果结账本身平均耗时 1 分钟，那么结账子系统内的并发是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>checkout</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{checkout}} = 1000 \\times 1 = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">checkout</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 人，剩下约 9000 人在等待区。若希望把总时长压到 5 分钟，则需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60000</mn><mo>×</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mn>5000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 60000 \\times \\tfrac{1}{12} = 5000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5000</span></span></span></span></span>，这必须通过<strong>提高处理速率或增加服务容量</strong>实现——仅仅缩小等待区的容量并不能减少等待时间，它只是让溢出的人被拒绝或需要稍后重试。</p>\n<h3 id=\"需求供给比是选型的第一判据\">需求供给比是选型的第一判据</h3><p>这个计算直接给出了选型的定量判据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求供给比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>建议机制</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 3</td>\n<td>直接售卖</td>\n<td>排队也几乎不用等，抽签是过度设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 – 10</td>\n<td>排队 + 削峰</td>\n<td>等待时长为分钟级，用户可接受；容量投入可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 – 50</td>\n<td>排队或抽签</td>\n<td>取决于等待容忍度与转化要求，需实测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 50</td>\n<td>抽签</td>\n<td>排队等待时长以小时计，体验崩溃；且机器人优势无法抵消</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 大于 50 时排队的根本问题不是技术上的（可以用无限长的虚拟队列实现），而是<strong>体验上的</strong>：等待几小时才能知道能否购买，与直接抽签相比没有任何优势，反而给了机器人更长的操作窗口。这就是限量球鞋、演唱会门票这类场景普遍采用抽签的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"削峰与降载-排队的必要配套\">削峰与降载：排队的必要配套</h2><h3 id=\"令牌桶允许受控突发\">令牌桶允许受控突发</h3><p>排队的可行性依赖于削峰能力。核心机制是<strong>准入控制</strong>：系统不直接暴露购买入口，而是通过发放排队令牌把进入速率限制在服务容量之内。令牌的发放速率决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>准入控制本身可以借用经典的限速算法。<strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Token_bucket\">令牌桶</a></strong> 的语义是：桶容量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 补充令牌，&quot;每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 秒向桶中添加一个令牌，桶最多可容纳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个令牌&quot;；一个大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的请求通过的条件是桶中至少有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个令牌，通过则扣除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，否则不做任何扣除并判定为不合规。用惰性补充的方式表达：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tokens = b; last = now()&#10;allow(n):&#10;    now_t = now()&#10;    tokens = min(b, tokens + r * (now_t - last))&#10;    last = now_t&#10;    if tokens &gt;= n:&#10;        tokens -= n&#10;        return true&#10;    return false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = b; last = now()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow(n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    now_t = now()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokens = min(b, tokens + r * (now_t - last))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    last = now_t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if tokens >= n:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokens -= n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return false</span></span></code></pre></div><p>令牌桶允许突发（最多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求瞬时通过），这对排队系统的意义是让准入速率在短窗口内可以略高于平均吞吐，从而更好地利用后端容量。如果希望输出完全平滑（不允许突发），可以用漏桶作为队列版本——它让请求以恒定速率流出，但会引入额外延迟。选择哪一个取决于后端对突发是否敏感：大多数无状态服务可以承受受控突发，因此令牌桶更常见。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按关键性等级降载\">按关键性等级降载</h3><p>当后端已经过载时，仅仅限速不够，还需要<strong>降载（load shedding）</strong>。<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/handling-overload/\">Google SRE 的经验</a>给出了一套可操作的做法：容量应以实际资源（主要是 CPU）而非&quot;每秒查询数&quot;建模，因为不同请求的成本差异很大；每个 RPC 携带一个关键性等级（<code>CRITICAL_PLUS</code>、<code>CRITICAL</code>、<code>SHEDDABLE_PLUS</code>、<code>SHEDDABLE</code>），过载时<strong>先丢弃低关键性的流量</strong>，且关键性会沿调用链向下传播。</p>\n<p>对抽签/排队系统而言，这套分级映射得很自然：<strong>核销与支付是 CRITICAL_PLUS，结果查询是 CRITICAL，热度统计与埋点上报是 SHEDDABLE_PLUS，日志明细是 SHEDDABLE</strong>。开奖瞬间的过载几乎总是由低价值流量引起的——把埋点和明细日志的等级设低，可以避免它们挤掉支付路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"客户端自适应限流防重试风暴\">客户端自适应限流防重试风暴</h3><p>客户端侧还有一个防重试风暴的机制。SRE 的<strong>自适应限流</strong>让客户端根据后端拒绝率在本地丢弃多余请求，拒绝概率按下式计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>requests</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>accepts</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>requests</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max\\left(0, \\frac{\\text{requests} - K \\cdot \\text{accepts}}{\\text{requests} + 1}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">requests</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">requests</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepts</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>requests</code> 是应用发出的尝试数，<code>accepts</code> 是被后端接受的数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是接受倍数（SRE 描述中 Google 通常取 2）。当 <code>requests</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>accepts</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\times \\text{accepts}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepts</span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，本地拒绝概率开始上升。把这个机制用在抽签的报名与核销客户端上，可以显著减少&quot;后端已经饱和、客户端还在重试&quot;造成的自我打垮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[用户请求] --&gt; B{排队令牌可用?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[进入虚拟等待区&lt;br/&gt;展示预估位置]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[通过准入]&#10;  D --&gt; E{后端利用率 &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[正常处理]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G{请求关键性等级}&#10;  G --&gt;|CRITICAL_PLUS| F&#10;  G --&gt;|CRITICAL| H[降级:简化响应]&#10;  G --&gt;|SHEDDABLE| I[丢弃 + 返回可重试]&#10;  C --&gt; J[定期重估&lt;br/&gt;按令牌发放速率前进]\">graph TD\n  A[用户请求] --&gt; B{排队令牌可用?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[进入虚拟等待区&lt;br/&gt;展示预估位置]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[通过准入]\n  D --&gt; E{后端利用率 &gt; 阈值?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[正常处理]\n  E --&gt;|是| G{请求关键性等级}\n  G --&gt;|CRITICAL_PLUS| F\n  G --&gt;|CRITICAL| H[降级:简化响应]\n  G --&gt;|SHEDDABLE| I[丢弃 + 返回可重试]\n  C --&gt; J[定期重估&lt;br/&gt;按令牌发放速率前进]</pre><h2 id=\"混合方案-先排队后抽签\">混合方案：先排队后抽签</h2><p>两种机制并非互斥。一个在实践中很有效的混合方案是：<strong>用排队控制报名入口的流量，用抽签决定购买权</strong>。</p>\n<p>具体做法是，在报名开放时给入口加一层准入控制（令牌桶 + 关键性分级），让系统的实际负载保持在容量内；报名窗口持续一个较长的时间段（例如 24 小时），期间的报名全部有效且不区分先后；窗口关闭后按抽签分配。</p>\n<p>这个组合同时解决了两个问题：它避免了&quot;报名瞬间的流量尖峰&quot;（用准入控制平滑），又保留了&quot;概率公平&quot;（用抽签分配）。代价是用户失去了即时反馈，因此需要在前端明确告知&quot;这是一个抽签，早报名和晚报名的机会相同&quot;——如果界面暗示&quot;先来先得&quot;，用户会疯狂刷新，准入控制就白做了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型时应该问的四个问题\">选型时应该问的四个问题</h2><p>把上面的分析浓缩成一组可以在评审会上直接使用的判据：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是多少？</strong> 若大于 50，几乎必然选抽签；小于 3，两者都不必要。</li>\n<li><strong>用户能接受多长的等待？</strong> 若可接受时长小于计算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，则排队的容量投入必须提高，或者改选抽签。</li>\n<li><strong>商品的公平叙事重要吗？</strong> 联名、限量、收藏品强调&quot;机会均等&quot;，抽签更契合；日常商品强调效率，排队更契合。</li>\n<li><strong>能否承担转售风险？</strong> 抽签必须配套身份去重与候补机制（见 <a href=\"../identity-limit-binding/\">身份与限购绑定</a>），如果团队没有这部分能力，抽签反而会制造更大的黄牛空间——因为它在报名与购买之间插入了一个可被利用的时间差。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 4 条是最容易被忽略的风险。抽签把&quot;抢购&quot;换成了&quot;报名 + 等待&quot;，而这个时间差恰恰是黄牛做多账号准备、以及组织化运作的窗口。没有身份去重的抽签，<strong>比排队更糟</strong>：排队至少要求人在那一刻在线，抽签不要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>抽签分配概率，排队分配到达顺序；前者对&quot;手速&quot;免疫但转化低，后者即时但机器人全程占优。</li>\n<li>用 Little&#39;s Law <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 量化排队容量，注意使用<strong>有效到达率</strong>（被拒用户不计入）；缩小等待区不能减少等待时间，只能提高服务容量或处理速率。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D/S &gt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 时排队的等待时长以小时计，体验不可接受，抽签成为必然选择。</li>\n<li>排队的必要配套是准入控制（令牌桶允许受控突发）+ 降载（按关键性等级丢弃，核销支付为 CRITICAL_PLUS、埋点日志为 SHEDDABLE）+ 客户端自适应限流（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>requests</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>accepts</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>requests</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(0, (\\text{requests} - K\\cdot\\text{accepts})/(\\text{requests}+1))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">requests</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepts</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">requests</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>混合方案（排队做准入、抽签做分配）可以同时平滑峰值与保持概率公平，但前端必须明确&quot;早报名与晚报名机会相同&quot;，否则用户会疯狂刷新。</li>\n<li>抽签把&quot;手速竞争&quot;换成了&quot;时间差窗口&quot;，没有身份去重的抽签比排队更糟。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽签 vs 排队的场景选择","id":"抽签-vs-排队的场景选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两种机制分配的是不同的东西","id":"两种机制分配的是不同的东西"},{"level":3,"text":"分配依据决定了一切下游差异","id":"分配依据决定了一切下游差异"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Little's Law 量化排队需要多少容量","id":"用-little-s-law-量化排队需要多少容量"},{"level":3,"text":"用有效到达率而不是原始到达率","id":"用有效到达率而不是原始到达率"},{"level":3,"text":"需求供给比是选型的第一判据","id":"需求供给比是选型的第一判据"},{"level":2,"text":"削峰与降载：排队的必要配套","id":"削峰与降载-排队的必要配套"},{"level":3,"text":"令牌桶允许受控突发","id":"令牌桶允许受控突发"},{"level":3,"text":"按关键性等级降载","id":"按关键性等级降载"},{"level":3,"text":"客户端自适应限流防重试风暴","id":"客户端自适应限流防重试风暴"},{"level":2,"text":"混合方案：先排队后抽签","id":"混合方案-先排队后抽签"},{"level":2,"text":"选型时应该问的四个问题","id":"选型时应该问的四个问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结果通知与购买时限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-experience-ops/raffle-result-notify-window"},"next":{"title":"限量发售热度与需求度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fair-raffle-limited-release/raffle-experience-ops/limited-release-demand-gauge"}}